{
  "slug": "liquid-glass-carousel",
  "name": "Liquid Glass Carousel",
  "description": "An endless photo row seen through a WebGL liquid-glass lens: a rotated ellipse that swirls the image at its rim, splits it into colour and glows with a ring; drag, flick, scroll or use the arrows, click the middle photo to focus it. Copia rebuilds it without three.js or GSAP and adds autoplay, a lens colour, rounded panels and a background that follows the theme.",
